            </p>
            
            <p>
               O
               <lb n="2" break="no"/>ymā-ṉāṭṭu kiḷi<unclear>ñe</unclear>lūr tikaittiṟal vi<hi rend="grantha">ṣṇu<unclear>gra</unclear>ham·</hi> Eṭu
               <lb n="3" break="no"/>ppitta tikaittiṟalār tiruviḷakku<supplied reason="omitted">k</supplied>ku vaitta Āṭu mu-<choice><orig><unclear>n</unclear>n</orig><reg>n</reg></choice>ūṟum Ivarē tiru-v-amu
